        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#151d27] p-6 shadow-xl">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-lg font-bold text-primary">
            🔍
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white">Zero Safari Auto-Zoom</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-neutral">
            Strict 16px minimum font size styling on all text search and barangay inputs prevents iOS Safari from triggering
            disruptive auto-zooming and layout shifts when keyboard inputs open.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#151d27] p-6 shadow-xl">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-lg font-bold text-primary">
